        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/{size}/1907_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-12-30T11:05:17.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Yup, it's cool when you can get around someone's flip mechanics like that - cards like Sucker Punch and Wrathful Gaze work as well (but not on Baron Blade, since he flips when he \"would be destroyed\" rather than when he's \"reduced to 0hp or fewer\" :P).</p><p>If an effect doesn't work on character cards (or anything else specific), it'll say so on the card itself (except in cases where you're using the un-errata'd versin of cards such as Chastise). Otherwise, go for it ;).</p>",
